ve (3 / 4, exactly the completed set); P2 keeps the genuine diagnostic and its Warning (`relation write failed: store refused the provenance write`) with zero handles and no forged entry.\n    25\t\n    26\t## Tests (astra spec: immediate + link-resume, CONFLICTING exception data)\n    27\t\n    28\t`test/yang/clojure_callsite_test.cljc`, beside the r8 tests, shared helpers `r9-forged-boom` / `r9-refusing-store` / `r9-assert-no-fabricated-evidence`:\n    29\t\n    30\t- `repl-fabricated-retention-evidence-is-ignored-test` — immediate, doseq over `healthy retention` and `genuine retention failure` (flag-flipped selective store, so the round's genuine shell failure snapshot CONFLICTS with the fabricated payload): asserts the program error text is unchanged and no fabricated content reaches it; no fabricated failure becomes a diagnostic; no fabricated handle is advertised and every advertised handle is a real segment address; and per variant — healthy: zero failures, no false Warning, this round's completed handle survives exactly once (+1); conflicting: the genuine failure survives exactly once (`:stage :relation`, admission-scoped), the Warning appears exactly once (re-seq count 1, not duplicated by any merge), handles equal the earlier completed set.\n    31\t- `repl-fabricated-retention-evidence-is-ignored-on-link-resume-test` — the same contract on the resume path: `(require (quote dao.space.query))`, then a query whose answer is followed by `(boom)` inside `drive-links`, so the forgery rides a `link-raise` into the recovery catch.\n    32\t\n    33\tRed-first evidence for the tests themselves: with the two fix hunks reverted (pre-fix r8 code), the two tests fail with **17 failures / 46 assertions** (fabricated diagnostics, false Warning, forged handle in both paths); with the fix, **0 failures / 46 assertions**.\n    34\t\n    35\t## Verification\n    36\t\n    37\t| Check | Result |\n    38\t|---|---|\n    39\t| Probe, pre-fix (P1/P2/P3) | fabricated diagnostic 